    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/tour-booking-agency/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "The Tour Booking Agency Theme is a professional, modern, and fully responsive solution designed for travel agencies, tour operators, holiday booking companies, adventure travel brands, destination management firms, vacation planners, and travel consultants looking to create a high-converting online travel store. Perfect for showcasing tour packages, travel services, itineraries, destinations, excursions, adventure trips, seasonal travel deals, family trips, luxury holidays, cultural experiences, cruises, city tours, group travel, travel accessories, and curated vacation bundles, this theme features a clean, customizable layout with adjustable colors, fonts, sections, and layouts to match your brand identity. It includes well-structured sections for tour packages, booking forms, travel blogs, photo galleries, and customer testimonials to boost conversions and inquiries. Lightweight, fast-loading, and SEO-friendly, the theme ensures smooth performance across desktops, tablets, and smartphones while helping your travel website rank higher in search results. Fully compatible with WooCommerce for secure payments and selling travel-related products, as well as popular booking and reservation plugins, it also integrates Contact Form 7 for inquiries and lead generation, and Yoast SEO for better online visibility. Supporting multilingual content and offering flexibility for adventure tours, vacation packages, and travel services, the Tour Booking Agency Theme provides a stylish, functional, and conversion-focused platform to grow your travel business effectively. Demo: https://preview.wpelemento.com/tour-booking-agency/"
    },
